[{"commit":{"message":"8391900\n\nHi all,\n\n  please review this change that puts the card set group state into G1CardSetGroup instead of replicating the state through all regions in that G1CardSetGroup.\n\nNext to being a lot cleaner, it gives opportunity to iterate just over the card set groups instead of all regions in the entire heap to find e.g. all humongous card set groups.\n\nMain change apart from moving stuff is related to using the information in determining the set of regions to update before rebuilding card sets, and afterwards.\n\nNote that there is a follow-up to clean up the g1RemSetSummary class wrt to naming. It would add around +100\/-100 more LOC to this already fairly large change.\n\nTesting: gha, tier1-3\n\nThanks,\n  Thomas"},"files":[{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CardSetGroup.cpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CardSetGroup.hpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CardSetGroup.inline.hpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CollectedHeap.cpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CollectedHeap.hpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CollectedHeap.inline.hpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CollectionSet.cpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CollectionSet.hpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CollectionSetCandidates.cpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CollectionSetCandidates.hpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1CollectionSetCandidates.inline.hpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1ConcurrentMark.cpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1ConcurrentMarkRemarkTasks.cpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1ConcurrentMarkRemarkTasks.hpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1FullGCResetMetadataTask.cpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1HeapRegion.cpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1HeapRegion.hpp"},{"filename":"src\/hotspot\/share\/gc\/g1\/g1HeapRegionRemSet.cpp"